
# Future Sight's overlay (row 13): the game's cloud, puff, ring arc and gem trim; real item icons. The drawn set is in
# art/future_sight/drawn/, each one's fallback.

image art/future_sight/icon_flambe.png
  fallback art/future_sight/drawn/icon_flambe.png
  load icon ICON_171
  scale 32 32 texel
  alpha cut 128
end

